"every download this instance was receiving from ``peer``, opens a fresh "
"transfer listener and asks the sender to continue the file from the bytes"
" already on disk. Restored uploads need no action here: the peer drives "
"their resume from its own side."
msgstr ""

#: PyFlow.network_api.connect_tcp.TCP_Server_Base.resume_transfers:9
